    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Minimal Soundboard for Maximum Control.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engineered for speed and simplicity, SoundCat gives you total control over your audio triggers. With hotkey support, and usage stats. It's everything you need without the bloat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/extras/8fe8323b1ab71b684d709d64201340d4.avif?t=1752254368\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global Hotkeys</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger sounds anytime, anywhere, even while gaming or tabbed out.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Customizable</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from built-in themes, fonts, and icon styles to match your setup.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usage Stats</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your most-played sounds and monitor your soundboard usage over time.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock achievements just by using SoundCat.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/extras/af7e4099e4a612e2f1385eb88191ff75.avif?t=1752254368\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SoundCat Overlay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compact overlay for all your sounds and hotkeys that stays on top of your games and applications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/extras/15d443b3e514779568b4e8e5aedaa6bd.avif?t=1752254368\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Minimal Soundboard for Maximum Control.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engineered for speed and simplicity, SoundCat gives you total control over your audio triggers. With hotkey support, and usage stats. It's everything you need without the bloat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/extras/8fe8323b1ab71b684d709d64201340d4.avif?t=1752254368\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global Hotkeys</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trigger sounds anytime, anywhere, even while gaming or tabbed out.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully Customizable</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from built-in themes, fonts, and icon styles to match your setup.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usage Stats</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your most-played sounds and monitor your soundboard usage over time.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock achievements just by using SoundCat.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/extras/af7e4099e4a612e2f1385eb88191ff75.avif?t=1752254368\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SoundCat Overlay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compact overlay for all your sounds and hotkeys that stays on top of your games and applications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782290/extras/15d443b3e514779568b4e8e5aedaa6bd.avif?t=1752254368\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p>",
